# ==== Secrets / env ====
# Chan het .env va moi bien the (.env.local, .env.development.local...).
.env
.env.*

# Ngoai le CO CHU DICH:
#  - *.example: file mau, khong chua gia tri that.
#  - .env.production: Vite chi nhung bien tien to VITE_* vao bundle JS, nghia la
#    MOI gia tri trong day deu CONG KHAI theo thiet ke (Firebase Web API key,
#    base URL). File nay can cho `npm run build` truoc khi firebase deploy nen
#    giu trong repo. ⚠️ TUYET DOI khong dat bi mat that (JWT secret, API secret
#    cua ben thu 3) vao day — bi mat that thuoc ve server/.env.
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!.env.production

# Cache cua Firebase CLI khi deploy hosting
.firebase/

